        "summary": "Weak antiferromagnetic Gd···Gd exchange in the Gd6 wheel. Room-temperature μeff/μB = 19.44 (matches six non-interacting Gd3+); decreases to 11.24 at 1.8 K. Magnetization 42.3 NAμB at 2 K and 7 T. Fitted J in the range −0.117(4) to −0.152(4) cm−1 for the series. Magnetocaloric −ΔSM = 25.07 J K−1 kg−1 at 2 K and ΔB = 7 T.",
